<!-- @after 12. Further Reading :: recap -->
### Say these in the interview

- Reference-count quote subscriptions and release them on cancellation; quotes are ephemeral presentation data.
- Create one clientOrderId per decision and commit the order before sending.
- Keep accountId fixed in every order call, recovery row and work input.
- A timeout or 404 cannot prove non-placement. Resolve with the same key, and require an atomic abandon fence before declaring expiry.
- Render version-ordered Room state and broker-supplied buying power and disclosures; do not hardcode changing trading rules.
